ollowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T14:43:20Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T14:43:20Z","body":"For a simple user and a beginner this is not a clear name, even for me now this is not a clear name.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3210902842/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3212979393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3212979393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3212979393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_gizB","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T04:17:47Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T04:20:44Z","body":"Is the SVG image format the only possible DPI-aware format that exists in the universe? DPITexture sounds like a broad term that may cover a bunch of use cases.\r\nTo me, the DPI Texture should be an abstract type, and implemented by the SVG Texture type, so that the team or the user can at least extend the type if needed.\r\n\r\nIf we ship the DPITexture as the current SVG implementation, I'm afraid we may never extend it to cover more vectorized use-cases in the future until 5.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3212979393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213065099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3213065099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3213065099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_g3uL","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T05:17:32Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T05:17:32Z","body":"> If we ship the DPITexture as the current SVG implementation, I'm afraid we may never extend it to cover more vectorized use-cases in the future until 5.\r\n\r\nYour statement highlights why we changed the name. This was never meant to be a general purpose SVG rendering resource. It was only ever meant to be a way to have DPI aware icons and other GUI elements. \r\n\r\nWe want to have a simple way of rendering vector graphics, but this is not the right way to do it. In the long run having an SVG texture that isn't intended to be used to render SVGs would be more confusing than making this change","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3213065099/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215229748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3215229748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3215229748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_pIM0","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-22T18:19:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-22T18:19:22Z","body":"> Is the SVG image format the only possible DPI-aware format that exists in the universe? DPITexture sounds like a broad term that may cover a bunch of use cases.\r\n\r\nThere are other vector image formats out there (EPS, PDF, Adobe Illustrator, ...) but these are generally not used in games. However, it's likely technically possible to create an add-on to import those formats as DPITexture.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3215229748/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3216931037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3216931037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3216931037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_vnjd","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":