events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T15:30:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-23T15:30:49Z","body":"> : / But `DPITexture` to me is an even broader term that brings me more unrealistic expectations though...\r\n\r\nCould you elaborate? What expectations does it give you? \r\n\r\nWhile we would prefer not to, we can change the name before release if it really is more problematic than SVGTexture","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217114136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217115220","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3217115220","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3217115220,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_wUhU","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T15:32:06Z","updated_at":"2025-08-23T15:32:06Z","body":"> While the original name might have led people to have unrealistic expectations, the new name is super not obvious to most users :/\r\n\r\nThat's the point! It's really only intended for use in the editor. Since it's purpose is so limited, we only want people who really need this exact functionality to use it. 99% of users won't need it. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217115220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217124420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3217124420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3217124420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_wWxE","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T15:41:05Z","updated_at":"2025-08-23T15:41:05Z","body":"> That's the point! It's really only intended for use in the editor.\r\n\r\nNot only the editor, it's used in the project theme as well, but the only intended end user usage for it is redefining theme elements like checkboxes, drag handles, and icons, which is rare (and only useful if you are suing `canvas_item` scaling mode or subviewports for UI).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217124420/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217176117","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3217176117","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3217176117,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_wjY1","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T16:58:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-23T17:25:13Z","body":"> Could you elaborate? What expectations does it give you?\r\n\r\n@clayjohn, It gives me the expectation that this Type can accept multiple different sources to achieve DPI-Awareness, such as selecting from an array of varying resolution Texture2Ds, e.g. [Windows App Icon](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/design/style/iconography/app-icon-construction#app-icon), or I can extend this type to create procedurally generated texture such as DPI aware background with gradient and rounded corners (where in the reality it only works with SVGs)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217176117/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217234880","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109811#issuecomment-3217234880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109811","id":3217234880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_wxvA","user":{"login":"mooflu","id":693717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzcxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/693717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu","html_url":"https://github.com/mooflu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mooflu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-23T18:10:53Z","updated_a